5:["$","$L13",null,{"post":{"id":"p_reproducible-data-analysis-workflow","slug":"reproducible-data-analysis-workflow","title":{"en":"A Practical Workflow for Reproducible Data Analysis","ne":"पुनरुत्पादनयोग्य डाटा विश्लेषणको व्यावहारिक वर्कफ्लो"},"excerpt":{"en":"Reproducibility is a time-saving strategy: the person you are protecting is future you, three weeks from now, under deadline.","ne":"पुनरुत्पादनशीलता समय बचाउने रणनीति हो: तपाईंले जोगाउन खोज्नुभएको व्यक्ति तीन हप्तापछिको तपाईं नै हुनुहुन्छ।"},"content":{"en":"Reproducible analysis means someone else — or you, later — can start from raw data and arrive at the same numbers without asking a single question.\n\n## The five-folder structure\n\n- `01_raw` — untouched source files, read-only.\n- `02_clean` — cleaning scripts and their outputs.\n- `03_analysis` — models, tests, figures.\n- `04_output` — tables and charts used in the document.\n- `05_docs` — data dictionary, decisions log, environment file.\n\n## Never edit raw data by hand\n\nEvery transformation lives in a script. If a value is wrong in the source, record the correction in the script with a reason.\n\n## Keep a decisions log\n\nOne plain text file, appended chronologically: date, decision, reason, alternative rejected. This single file answers most examiner questions before they are asked.\n\n> If a number appears in your document, a script must be able to produce it from files in `01_raw`.","ne":"पुनरुत्पादनयोग्य विश्लेषणको अर्थ — अर्को व्यक्तिले (वा पछि तपाईंले) कच्चा डाटाबाट सुरु गरेर एउटै सङ्ख्यामा पुग्न सक्नु, एउटा पनि प्रश्न नसोधी।\n\n## पाँच फोल्डर संरचना\n\n- `01_raw` — नछोइएको स्रोत फाइल।\n- `02_clean` — सफाइ स्क्रिप्ट र नतिजा।\n- `03_analysis` — मोडेल, परीक्षण, चित्र।\n- `04_output` — कागजातमा प्रयोग भएका तालिका र चार्ट।\n- `05_docs` — डाटा शब्दकोश, निर्णय लग, इन्भाइरोन्मेन्ट फाइल।\n\n> कागजातमा देखिने हरेक सङ्ख्या `01_raw` बाट स्क्रिप्टले बनाउन सक्नुपर्छ।"},"cover":"art:editorial","author":"Acttolog Editorial","category":"Technology","tags":["data","workflow"],"publishedAt":"2026-09-12","updatedAt":"","status":"published","access":"public","audience":"global","featured":false,"seoTitle":"A Practical Workflow for Reproducible Data Analysis | Acttolog","seoDescription":"Reproducibility is a time-saving strategy: the person you are protecting is future you, three weeks from now, under deadline.","socialImage":""}}]
